abstract: "A technical position paper on user-to-LLM instruction integrity, provenance, effective authority and agentic IDE request composition. Presents a verbatim defensive global-instructions case and proposes a request-level PBoM and security-focused evaluation protocol. No unauthorized prompt rewrite or successful injection is claimed."
